    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12241" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπνοια</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>freedom from wind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>windlessness, calm,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				944b12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				34.11.19
			</span></i> (v.l.); <i>want of wind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.7.5
			</span></i>; <i>shelter from wind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				785a29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>absence of respiration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.959
			</span></i>.</div>
